# I1329: desktop (Mac) UI hooks MUI does not call. Checked by tests/ui/mui_mac_hook_parity.cmake (ctest mui-mac-hook-parity).
# Line: "<hook> <reason>". A gap names its ledger row; remove the line when the MUI twin lands (the test fails on a
# stale line). Gap table: thoughts/shared/research/2026-11-14-mui-mac-gap-table.md. I1329a-k are proposed rows there.

