# --- Not gaps: desktop pixel layout, dumps and self-checks, or MUI reaches the same data another way ---
sel_uim_actions_check desktop --actions self-check print; the action table itself is shared (mui_menu_build)
sel_uim_exemption_count desktop --actions self-check print
sel_uim_breakpoint_name desktop resize replay dump
sel_uim_budget_allows desktop pixel budget (rgba32/index8 canvas); MUI draws through MUI
sel_uim_default_format desktop canvas format pick
sel_uim_footer_height desktop pixel layout; MUI lays out with MUI groups
sel_uim_hit desktop pointer hit-test over its own layout; MUI objects get their own clicks
sel_uim_layout_check desktop pixel layout self-check
sel_uim_layout_compute_bar desktop pixel layout; MUI uses sel_uim_layout_compute_tier_expand
sel_uim_layout_compute_panel desktop pixel layout
sel_uim_layout_set_side_width desktop pixel layout (sidebar drag)
sel_uim_cols_split desktop column pixel split; MUI columns come from mui_aalist_cols
sel_uim_cols_calls desktop dump counter of the column split
sel_uim_motion_allowed desktop animation gate; MUI has no animation
sel_uim_page_at desktop dump / control names; MUI resolves pages with sel_uim_page_by_name and sel_uim_door_at
sel_uim_song_menu_n desktop item count for pointer hit-test; MUI builds the menu from sel_uim_song_menu_label
sel_uim_pref_choice desktop draws the choice text; MUI uses sel_uim_pref_choice_index and sel_uim_pref_line
sel_uim_dlg_title MUI reads the same I1368 table through sel_uim_dlg_text and sel_uim_dlg_mui_gadgets
sel_uim_dlg_confirm_label MUI reads the same I1368 table through sel_uim_dlg_mui_gadgets
sel_uim_dlg_cancel_label MUI reads the same I1368 table through sel_uim_dlg_mui_gadgets
sel_uim_stats_rows desktop stats panel rows; MUI Statistics window uses sel_uim_stats_row (I1181)
sel_route_kind_name desktop dump only
sel_engine_stats_get engine counters for the desktop dump and perf lines; MUI Statistics reads the STATS reply (I1181)
sel_engine_lib_deferred desktop dump counter only
sel_engine_lib_nowait desktop direct engine read on the Playlists page; MUI reads rows from sel_engine_state
sel_engine_lib_site desktop direct engine read on the Playlists page; MUI reads rows from sel_engine_state
sel_engine_library_items_busy desktop sidebar lazy library fetch; MUI sidebar reads the view rows
sel_engine_library_items_post desktop sidebar lazy library fetch
sel_engine_library_items_take desktop sidebar lazy library fetch
sel_engine_song_briefs_busy desktop direct briefs read; MUI posts through sel_uim_briefs_post and takes with sel_engine_song_briefs_take
sel_engine_song_briefs_post desktop direct briefs read; MUI posts through sel_uim_briefs_post
